Evander supplied the current journal spread, item art, title plates, dividers,
glyphs, paperclip, and action icons. The journal uses new cloth bookmark tabs
and a native ink highlight for index rows.

The Spade and Slime Stone are inspired by Quark’s Trowel and Slime in a Bucket (Violet Moon, build 4.1-488). Evander supplied the Spade, Slime Stone, Knowledge Stone and Coral Squid Spawn Egg artwork.

