Runic amethyst and the journal’s carved glyph faces derive from Strange by Sven Hjól (MIT; see LICENSE.charm-and-strange). Evander supplied the Rune Dust, Rune Pearl and journal back, edit and trash artwork.

Decorative amethyst textures by Nexo Assets, from the purchased Amethyst pack. https://mcmodels.net/vendors/18/nexo-assets
Single-face glyph variants on the amethyst bricks by Evander. The purchased artwork retains its own license.

Protogen: Minecraft Protogen Model by Endles13, adapted for Protomod by downloadableduck.
https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/minecraft-protogen-model-1cf00d1d4fda4a008036410fc213bdee
This port converts the Protomod geometry into Horizon model parts, preserving pivots
and face UVs and scaling the model to a hostile mob. The adapted model is provided
under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, including the changes to the model in this port:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/ (LICENSE.protogen-model).
Protomod supplies the default Ice skin and the idle, walk and punch clips; the clips
were converted into Horizon keyframes. Protomod lists MIT (LICENSE.protomod).
https://modrinth.com/mod/protomod
https://github.com/downloadableduck/protomod/tree/eb7b7397a368e471f044c7fae8970a2b6f8d1f7f
The green, indigo, magenta, purple, red and yellow Protogen skin variations are
Evander's recolors of the Ice skin.
